(1944678, 268200, 45672, '<td valign="top">Great great great.  This is just perfect.  way to go.  Lighting is great.  The content is perfect.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great great great.  This is just perfect.  way to go.  Lighting is great.  The content is perfect.  Nicely done.', '2005-12-12 13:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
