(1944949, 267619, 6519, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful photo, but has nothing to do with the challenge: "Capture the spirit of the holidays like only a catalog can". If you had printed this out, framed it, and taken a photo of it together with some Christmas props, then you''d tie it into the challenge topic.</td>', 'This is a very beautiful photo, but has nothing to do with the challenge: "Capture the spirit of the holidays like only a catalog can". If you had printed this out, framed it, and taken a photo of it together with some Christmas props, then you''d tie it into the challenge topic.', '2005-12-12 15:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944950, 267277, 6519, '<td valign="top">"Capture the spirit of the holidays like only a catalog can" is part of the topic description. I don''t see any attempt to make this fit the theme.</td>', '"Capture the spirit of the holidays like only a catalog can" is part of the topic description. I don''t see any attempt to make this fit the theme.', '2005-12-12 15:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944955, 267934, 6519, '<td valign="top">"Capture the spirit of the holidays like only a catalog can" You''re not trying to sell that sweet child, are you?  ;-)<br/>Beautiful brown eyes, but has nothing to do with the challenge topic.</td>', '"Capture the spirit of the holidays like only a catalog can" You''re not trying to sell that sweet child, are you?  ;-)Beautiful brown eyes, but has nothing to do with the challenge topic.', '2005-12-12 15:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944961, 268238, 6519, '<td valign="top">If you had some distance from your background (plus a large aperture), it would help the problem of seeing every wrinkle and that stark shadow. Plus it would be better if the top of the hat wasn''t chopped off.</td>', 'If you had some distance from your background (plus a large aperture), it would help the problem of seeing every wrinkle and that stark shadow. Plus it would be better if the top of the hat wasn''t chopped off.', '2005-12-12 15:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944965, 267345, 6519, '<td valign="top">Very nice !!! I love the setup, the background, the shallow DOF. 8</td>', 'Very nice !!! I love the setup, the background, the shallow DOF. 8', '2005-12-12 15:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944967, 268225, 6519, '<td valign="top">I doubt that I''d find this in a Christmas Catalog.</td>', 'I doubt that I''d find this in a Christmas Catalog.', '2005-12-12 15:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944972, 267417, 6519, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the effort, you really tried to do a christmas catalog item. However, I find that reflection hard to look at - I guess it is because there is more than ONE reflection, there seem to be several layers of it. <br/>The placement of the studs could be better, too - this is too close to dead center, but not even quite there.</td>', 'I appreciate the effort, you really tried to do a christmas catalog item. However, I find that reflection hard to look at - I guess it is because there is more than ONE reflection, there seem to be several layers of it. The placement of the studs could be better, too - this is too close to dead center, but not even quite there.', '2005-12-12 15:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944975, 267341, 6519, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too cluttered with too many different elements distracting from the ring you are trying to show off. But you have some nice bokeh happening, and I appreciate the effort to make this look like something in a Christmas Catalog.</td>', 'This is a bit too cluttered with too many different elements distracting from the ring you are trying to show off. But you have some nice bokeh happening, and I appreciate the effort to make this look like something in a Christmas Catalog.', '2005-12-12 15:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944976, 267581, 6519, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what your catalog picture is trying to show off or sell.</td>', 'I''m not sure what your catalog picture is trying to show off or sell.', '2005-12-12 15:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944977, 268156, 45857, '<td valign="top">Since I can''t vote this challenge, I''ll just give you the "Golden" ribbon.<br/>Just wondering if you tried a tighter crop? I see it working well using only the bottom half. That and turning the top left package a bit CW would have cured the hot spot reflections.</td>', 'Since I can''t vote this challenge, I''ll just give you the "Golden" ribbon.Just wondering if you tried a tighter crop? I see it working well using only the bottom half. That and turning the top left package a bit CW would have cured the hot spot reflections.', '2005-12-12 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944979, 267499, 6519, '<td valign="top">This looks a little overexposed, but you made a nice effort to fit the challenge.</td>', 'This looks a little overexposed, but you made a nice effort to fit the challenge.', '2005-12-12 15:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1944982, 267888, 6519, '<td valign="top">I''m a big fan of a shallow DOF, but since you''re trying to sell us the WHOLE set (at least I would assume so), it would be better if ALL of it was in focus.</td>', 'I''m a big fan of a shallow DOF, but since you''re trying to sell us the WHOLE set (at least I would assume so), it would be better if ALL of it was in focus.', '2005-12-12 15:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
