(1946759, 268156, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Wish the paws on the left weren''t cut off though.</td>', 'Great shot!  Wish the paws on the left weren''t cut off though.', '2005-12-13 10:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946760, 268268, 42140, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!</td>', 'Beautiful colors!', '2005-12-13 10:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946862, 268052, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hmm, this little girl looks familiar?  Totifoto?  Anyway, nice shot, technically very well done with lighting and such and funny with those earrings, next year you could try putting her on the tree, I bet you´ll get a funny expression that way :D</td>', 'Hmm, this little girl looks familiar?  Totifoto?  Anyway, nice shot, technically very well done with lighting and such and funny with those earrings, next year you could try putting her on the tree, I bet you´ll get a funny expression that way :D', '2005-12-13 11:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946865, 267345, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice job technically speaking, could actually envision this in a catalouge somewhere.</td>', 'Nice job technically speaking, could actually envision this in a catalouge somewhere.', '2005-12-13 11:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946880, 268178, 27431, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, except for the chain link fringing. But what are you selling in our catalog?</td>', 'Not a bad shot, except for the chain link fringing. But what are you selling in our catalog?', '2005-12-13 11:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946881, 267417, 27431, '<td valign="top">The reflection is a bit too defined, IMHO. It confuses a bit</td>', 'The reflection is a bit too defined, IMHO. It confuses a bit', '2005-12-13 11:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946886, 268033, 27431, '<td valign="top">Maybe would have set off a bit more with a shade closer crop, and a little more symmetry.</td>', 'Maybe would have set off a bit more with a shade closer crop, and a little more symmetry.', '2005-12-13 11:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946889, 268179, 27431, '<td valign="top">Somebodies having a great Christmas! Welcome to the club.</td>', 'Somebodies having a great Christmas! Welcome to the club.', '2005-12-13 11:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946925, 267233, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lol!  Know that guaranteed at least one 10 from the man himself :)</td>', 'Lol!  Know that guaranteed at least one 10 from the man himself :)', '2005-12-13 11:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946931, 268227, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love that you made it b/w, i doubt I would have liked it as much in colour.  Love the b/w conversion too, great contrast and good lighting. 8 from me, one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Love that you made it b/w, i doubt I would have liked it as much in colour.  Love the b/w conversion too, great contrast and good lighting. 8 from me, one of the best in the challenge.', '2005-12-13 11:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946938, 267845, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but the lighting is a bit harsh for my taste, too many glaring headlights and strong shadows and it just doesn´t seem fitting for this shot to me.</td>', 'Nice composition but the lighting is a bit harsh for my taste, too many glaring headlights and strong shadows and it just doesn´t seem fitting for this shot to me.', '2005-12-13 11:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946954, 268272, 29490, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see a holiday song on the ipod<br/> <br/>nice concept, great photo! Good luck!</td>', 'Would have liked to see a holiday song on the ipod nice concept, great photo! Good luck!', '2005-12-13 11:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946955, 267669, 37961, '<td valign="top">Nice Balls. LOL Seriously though. One of my challenge Favs. Good Luck.</td>', 'Nice Balls. LOL Seriously though. One of my challenge Favs. Good Luck.', '2005-12-13 11:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946958, 267935, 29490, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Love  the leading line!!!</td>', 'Beautiful.  Love  the leading line!!!', '2005-12-13 11:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946962, 268208, 29490, '<td valign="top">Great lighting!! Excellent photo!</td>', 'Great lighting!! Excellent photo!', '2005-12-13 12:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946965, 268051, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but I think for a catalog the item for sale should be prominent.</td>', 'I like this shot, but I think for a catalog the item for sale should be prominent.', '2005-12-13 12:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946969, 267522, 43565, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but If I saw this in a catalog I do not know what they would be selling.</td>', 'Good shot, but If I saw this in a catalog I do not know what they would be selling.', '2005-12-13 12:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946972, 267568, 43565, '<td valign="top">Do you get all the lights shown?  I''m not sure I would find this type of picture in a catalog.</td>', 'Do you get all the lights shown?  I''m not sure I would find this type of picture in a catalog.', '2005-12-13 12:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946974, 267345, 48541, '<td valign="top">i love this one</td>', 'i love this one', '2005-12-13 12:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946975, 267494, 43565, '<td valign="top">I have never seen a picture like this in a catalog.  Are you selling the house, the decorations, the dog?</td>', 'I have never seen a picture like this in a catalog.  Are you selling the house, the decorations, the dog?', '2005-12-13 12:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946980, 268156, 43565, '<td valign="top">Not sure what is for sale in this shot.</td>', 'Not sure what is for sale in this shot.', '2005-12-13 12:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946982, 268178, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is supposed to be a holiday catalog.  I''m not sure how this fits the challenge.</td>', 'This is supposed to be a holiday catalog.  I''m not sure how this fits the challenge.', '2005-12-13 12:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946986, 268052, 43565, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, but I''m not sure I would find this in a catalog.  6 for now.</td>', 'Cute shot, but I''m not sure I would find this in a catalog.  6 for now.', '2005-12-13 12:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946994, 267531, 43565, '<td valign="top">I guess we don''t get the same catalogs!  I don''t really care for the background but the products are in focus.  6 for technicals, 1 for subject matter, final score-4</td>', 'I guess we don''t get the same catalogs!  I don''t really care for the background but the products are in focus.  6 for technicals, 1 for subject matter, final score-4', '2005-12-13 12:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1946997, 267345, 43565, '<td valign="top">Not the kind of catalog I would get.</td>', 'Not the kind of catalog I would get.', '2005-12-13 12:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947029, 268112, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and capture.  I''d have put some smoke fluid in to get some puffs from the engine though = )</td>', 'Nice idea and capture.  I''d have put some smoke fluid in to get some puffs from the engine though = )', '2005-12-13 12:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947032, 268279, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and exposure.  I like that the colors are more subdued (rather than vibrant).</td>', 'Nice composition and exposure.  I like that the colors are more subdued (rather than vibrant).', '2005-12-13 12:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947036, 268198, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting (particularly the tree in the background).  The composition is tight for my taste, I would''ve left more of the track underneath in the shot.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the lighting (particularly the tree in the background).  The composition is tight for my taste, I would''ve left more of the track underneath in the shot.  Nice shot.', '2005-12-13 12:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947047, 267370, 509, '<td valign="top">Great idea and exposure.  Composition might be strengthened if the lights were more at a diagonal (the straight horizontal and vertical lines could be improved by less rigid composition imho).</td>', 'Great idea and exposure.  Composition might be strengthened if the lights were more at a diagonal (the straight horizontal and vertical lines could be improved by less rigid composition imho).', '2005-12-13 12:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947049, 268190, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract, might be improved by having a more solid image of the subject (a tree?) and then have the light swirls surrounding that, rather than have the whole image full of the swirls (imho).  This could be done by using the long exposure as you have, but leaving the camera still on the subject for a longer period of time or maybe even throwing some light on it at the end of the exposure.</td>', 'Interesting abstract, might be improved by having a more solid image of the subject (a tree?) and then have the light swirls surrounding that, rather than have the whole image full of the swirls (imho).  This could be done by using the long exposure as you have, but leaving the camera still on the subject for a longer period of time or maybe even throwing some light on it at the end of the exposure.', '2005-12-13 12:39:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1947101, 267417, 45672, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, why am I seeing ghost images of the jewlery?  It looks like it was moving or something.  It looks a little blurry too.</td>', 'Hmmm, why am I seeing ghost images of the jewlery?  It looks like it was moving or something.  It looks a little blurry too.', '2005-12-13 13:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947104, 268284, 45672, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  I wish the whole picture was in focus though.  You might try taking this picture from a greater distance and then cropping it down to get everything is focus.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  I wish the whole picture was in focus though.  You might try taking this picture from a greater distance and then cropping it down to get everything is focus.', '2005-12-13 13:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947106, 268026, 45672, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  This is just great.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  This is just great.', '2005-12-13 13:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947109, 267357, 45672, '<td valign="top">Well, this was a good attempt, but the focus is a little out of whack and the background should be something other than white.</td>', 'Well, this was a good attempt, but the focus is a little out of whack and the background should be something other than white.', '2005-12-13 13:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947112, 268056, 45672, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture, but the wrinkled background is a little distracting.  It might have been better with some holly berries or something as the back ground.</td>', 'This is a nice picture, but the wrinkled background is a little distracting.  It might have been better with some holly berries or something as the back ground.', '2005-12-13 13:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947116, 268289, 45672, '<td valign="top">Everyone gets a calendar for christmas, so this is the cover of the CATS calendar.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Everyone gets a calendar for christmas, so this is the cover of the CATS calendar.  Nice shot.', '2005-12-13 13:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947120, 267722, 45672, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, but the lighting just isn''t right for this shot.  I think some soft light on the cookies would have made them stand out better.  The glare off of the table cloth needs to go.  Other than that, you had the right idea.</td>', 'Nicely composed, but the lighting just isn''t right for this shot.  I think some soft light on the cookies would have made them stand out better.  The glare off of the table cloth needs to go.  Other than that, you had the right idea.', '2005-12-13 13:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947125, 268272, 45672, '<td valign="top">Great use of your aperature to get the star effect on the lights.  The iPod could be clearer and if this was for a catalog, I would want the battery meter to show fully charged and you might want the play symbol instead of the pause symbol.  Nice job otherwise.</td>', 'Great use of your aperature to get the star effect on the lights.  The iPod could be clearer and if this was for a catalog, I would want the battery meter to show fully charged and you might want the play symbol instead of the pause symbol.  Nice job otherwise.', '2005-12-13 13:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947128, 268238, 45672, '<td valign="top">Good attempt.  The shadows would have to go for this one to be in a catalog.  You might have been better off have several ligth sources for this one.</td>', 'Good attempt.  The shadows would have to go for this one to be in a catalog.  You might have been better off have several ligth sources for this one.', '2005-12-13 13:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947130, 267886, 45672, '<td valign="top">Good shot, great for a catalog.  I think a white background may have been better.</td>', 'Good shot, great for a catalog.  I think a white background may have been better.', '2005-12-13 13:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947132, 267499, 45672, '<td valign="top">I think the shot is good.  There is too much light however and for a catalog, you would want the unit to be on and showing something on the screen.  The glare coming off the screen of the GPS takes away from it, therefore, you might use much less lighting for this shot.</td>', 'I think the shot is good.  There is too much light however and for a catalog, you would want the unit to be on and showing something on the screen.  The glare coming off the screen of the GPS takes away from it, therefore, you might use much less lighting for this shot.', '2005-12-13 13:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947135, 268168, 45672, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Very nicely done!  This is just great.</td>', 'WOW!  Very nicely done!  This is just great.', '2005-12-13 13:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947139, 267459, 45672, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but bears are a little out of focus.  This sort of has the valentines day look, but it could probably work either way.</td>', 'Great shot, but bears are a little out of focus.  This sort of has the valentines day look, but it could probably work either way.', '2005-12-13 13:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947142, 268112, 45672, '<td valign="top">More DOF would have been good.  I think taking the picture from a greater distance (say back a few feet) and then cropping down to this would get you a better shot.  Nice job on the idea and the composition.</td>', 'More DOF would have been good.  I think taking the picture from a greater distance (say back a few feet) and then cropping down to this would get you a better shot.  Nice job on the idea and the composition.', '2005-12-13 13:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947147, 268225, 45672, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this fits in a catalog, but it looks like it was a neat place to see.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this fits in a catalog, but it looks like it was a neat place to see.', '2005-12-13 13:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947151, 267333, 45672, '<td valign="top">Well, in my opinion, this would have been better if it were just snow and the watch.  Other than that, this is a great shot.</td>', 'Well, in my opinion, this would have been better if it were just snow and the watch.  Other than that, this is a great shot.', '2005-12-13 13:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947158, 268178, 45672, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph, but I can''t see the tie to the holiday catalog theme.</td>', 'Nice photograph, but I can''t see the tie to the holiday catalog theme.', '2005-12-13 13:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947196, 267739, 37961, '<td valign="top">Oh Yeah. Nice find.</td>', 'Oh Yeah. Nice find.', '2005-12-13 13:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947197, 268233, 37961, '<td valign="top">Nice twist on your liquor bottle shot. Works for me. Good lighting.</td>', 'Nice twist on your liquor bottle shot. Works for me. Good lighting.', '2005-12-13 13:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947347, 267233, 9111, '<td valign="top">tooo tooo   funny!!       the lighting onthe magazine is not the best but i give you credit for this being  hysterical !</td>', 'tooo tooo   funny!!       the lighting onthe magazine is not the best but i give you credit for this being  hysterical !', '2005-12-13 14:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947449, 267293, 45926, '<td valign="top">Yay Hanukkah! ^_^</td>', 'Yay Hanukkah! ^_^', '2005-12-13 15:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947464, 268200, 48995, '<td valign="top">it''s so sweet</td>', 'it''s so sweet', '2005-12-13 15:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947468, 267351, 35444, '<td valign="top">Butt paste!?  LOL</td>', 'Butt paste!?  LOL', '2005-12-13 15:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947571, 268200, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a fun image. My only beefs are a) I feel like either all the legs should be showing skin or none of them should, and b) the socks should be roughly the same length---the short pair bothers me. I like the high key background as a foil for the bright colors.</td>', 'This is a fun image. My only beefs are a) I feel like either all the legs should be showing skin or none of them should, and b) the socks should be roughly the same length---the short pair bothers me. I like the high key background as a foil for the bright colors.', '2005-12-13 16:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947581, 267360, 7322, '<td valign="top">There is a lack of color harmony here. The plum colored sweatshirt just does not relate well to the colors of the ornaments. The greenery is rather sparce and stingy looking and it looks kind of tired and faded. The elements all look too neatly arranged without actually harmonizing into an engaging composition.</td>', 'There is a lack of color harmony here. The plum colored sweatshirt just does not relate well to the colors of the ornaments. The greenery is rather sparce and stingy looking and it looks kind of tired and faded. The elements all look too neatly arranged without actually harmonizing into an engaging composition.', '2005-12-13 16:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947595, 268289, 7322, '<td valign="top">This cat really looks like he is trying to maintain his dignity while wearing what looks like a birthday party hat. I''m sure you were aware going in that you weren''t go to win any ribbons with this effort. It''s an amusing portrait of a cat but there is no relationship to the challenge. If it were wearing a Santa hat or reindeer ears or some other Christmas-y get-up it would be more appropriate to the challenge since I can certainly find that type of thing in a catalog.</td>', 'This cat really looks like he is trying to maintain his dignity while wearing what looks like a birthday party hat. I''m sure you were aware going in that you weren''t go to win any ribbons with this effort. It''s an amusing portrait of a cat but there is no relationship to the challenge. If it were wearing a Santa hat or reindeer ears or some other Christmas-y get-up it would be more appropriate to the challenge since I can certainly find that type of thing in a catalog.', '2005-12-13 16:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947633, 268000, 7322, '<td valign="top">Too much of the picture plane is dominated by the white and red background. The red clashes with the color of the stones. This would have really benefited from bringing the lens much closer to the subject and perhaps from a lower angle of view to make the earrings look larger or more dramatic. Shooting down on a subject tends to make it look smaller. The color and clarity of foremost stone is almost obliterated by the huge glare. This is a nice subject for the challenge and you clearly attempted to create a sophisticated still-life as is evident in that you took care to set up some sort of lighting and backdrop. Good effort.</td>', 'Too much of the picture plane is dominated by the white and red background. The red clashes with the color of the stones. This would have really benefited from bringing the lens much closer to the subject and perhaps from a lower angle of view to make the earrings look larger or more dramatic. Shooting down on a subject tends to make it look smaller. The color and clarity of foremost stone is almost obliterated by the huge glare. This is a nice subject for the challenge and you clearly attempted to create a sophisticated still-life as is evident in that you took care to set up some sort of lighting and backdrop. Good effort.', '2005-12-13 16:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947648, 267151, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photograph but  I think it''s stretching it to call this a holiday figurine. This appears to be a piece pf garden statuary with pagan origins,i.e,, a figure from classical mythology. Without the soft-focus tree in the background I wouldn''t get any sense of the holidays from this. Maybe if the boy had wings?</td>', 'This is a nice photograph but  I think it''s stretching it to call this a holiday figurine. This appears to be a piece pf garden statuary with pagan origins,i.e,, a figure from classical mythology. Without the soft-focus tree in the background I wouldn''t get any sense of the holidays from this. Maybe if the boy had wings?', '2005-12-13 16:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947650, 268200, 18590, '<td valign="top">super<br/></td>', 'super', '2005-12-13 16:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947656, 268112, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the greenery and ornaments as a framing element. I think you could have included a bit more of them.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the greenery and ornaments as a framing element. I think you could have included a bit more of them.', '2005-12-13 16:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947662, 267333, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept and fairly well executed. The watch looks great and I like the hint of the red scarf in the background (although it appears a bit murky).The snow in the foreground is a bit overexposed---most of the detail is blown out. Great effort!</td>', 'Very nice concept and fairly well executed. The watch looks great and I like the hint of the red scarf in the background (although it appears a bit murky).The snow in the foreground is a bit overexposed---most of the detail is blown out. Great effort!', '2005-12-13 16:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947669, 268085, 43565, '<td valign="top">Not sure what is for sale here.</td>', 'Not sure what is for sale here.', '2005-12-13 16:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947675, 267845, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice subject and you got in nice and close. The lighting leaves something to be desired----the shadows behind the figures are harsh and distracting. Also, the grey background behind the cut-out angel just looks plain bad. It is very drab and there are the shadows  that really stand out. Using a black background and positioning the creche further away from it would have provided a sense of space surrounding the creche. As it is it looks quite a bit cramped.</td>', 'This is a nice subject and you got in nice and close. The lighting leaves something to be desired----the shadows behind the figures are harsh and distracting. Also, the grey background behind the cut-out angel just looks plain bad. It is very drab and there are the shadows  that really stand out. Using a black background and positioning the creche further away from it would have provided a sense of space surrounding the creche. As it is it looks quite a bit cramped.', '2005-12-13 16:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947679, 267619, 43565, '<td valign="top">The challenge details say "Capture the spirit of the holidays like only a catalog can".  To me, this doesn''t capture the spirit.  I think you came up with an idea to allow you to do a free study...</td>', 'The challenge details say "Capture the spirit of the holidays like only a catalog can".  To me, this doesn''t capture the spirit.  I think you came up with an idea to allow you to do a free study...', '2005-12-13 16:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947688, 268251, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think the ornament should be more in focus.</td>', 'I think the ornament should be more in focus.', '2005-12-13 16:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947697, 268238, 7322, '<td valign="top">The folds, wrinkles, and shadows in the background give this a sloppy haphazard quality and pull focus from the main subject.</td>', 'The folds, wrinkles, and shadows in the background give this a sloppy haphazard quality and pull focus from the main subject.', '2005-12-13 16:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947711, 267728, 43565, '<td valign="top">Good setup of the food, if only it weren''t sliding overboard.  Not sure I would see this in a holiday catalog, but maybe in Australia?</td>', 'Good setup of the food, if only it weren''t sliding overboard.  Not sure I would see this in a holiday catalog, but maybe in Australia?', '2005-12-13 16:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947717, 268190, 43565, '<td valign="top">Not sure I would find tis in a catalog.</td>', 'Not sure I would find tis in a catalog.', '2005-12-13 16:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947719, 267903, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Harmonious colors, well lit with no harsh shadows, and a simple and pleasing composition.</td>', 'Very nice! Harmonious colors, well lit with no harsh shadows, and a simple and pleasing composition.', '2005-12-13 16:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947720, 268267, 43565, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I would find this in a holiday catalog.</td>', 'I don''t think I would find this in a holiday catalog.', '2005-12-13 16:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947723, 267581, 43565, '<td valign="top">This does not look like it would be in a catalog.</td>', 'This does not look like it would be in a catalog.', '2005-12-13 16:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947729, 268026, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the soft-focus, sparkly background.I wish you showed the whole bear though. This choice of cropping really spoils and otherwise very good shot.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the soft-focus, sparkly background.I wish you showed the whole bear though. This choice of cropping really spoils and otherwise very good shot.', '2005-12-13 16:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947731, 267853, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think this should have been shot straight.</td>', 'I think this should have been shot straight.', '2005-12-13 17:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947744, 267934, 43565, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this "Captures  the spirit of the holidays like only a catalog can."  I wouldn''t know it was the holidays without the title, and I am not sure what product is being sold.</td>', 'I don''t think this "Captures  the spirit of the holidays like only a catalog can."  I wouldn''t know it was the holidays without the title, and I am not sure what product is being sold.', '2005-12-13 17:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947761, 268157, 7322, '<td valign="top">There is a quriky, surreal quality to this photo that I really appreciate. I have no idea if it is a happy accident or purely intentional. It''s not just that Santa and his reindeer appear to be flying. It is also the odd placement of the tree in the picture plane and the clear blue otherwise empty sky. I might see this in a weird Christmas catalog.</td>', 'There is a quriky, surreal quality to this photo that I really appreciate. I have no idea if it is a happy accident or purely intentional. It''s not just that Santa and his reindeer appear to be flying. It is also the odd placement of the tree in the picture plane and the clear blue otherwise empty sky. I might see this in a weird Christmas catalog.', '2005-12-13 17:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947784, 267466, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice! This is a harmonious grouping of figures and the gift boxes make a nice foreground framing element without looking cluttered or distracting. This is nicely lit with no harsh shadows. The only thing I don''t get is the sno-globe with the birds that at first looked like weird kewpie figures to me.</td>', 'Very nice! This is a harmonious grouping of figures and the gift boxes make a nice foreground framing element without looking cluttered or distracting. This is nicely lit with no harsh shadows. The only thing I don''t get is the sno-globe with the birds that at first looked like weird kewpie figures to me.', '2005-12-13 17:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947796, 268305, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not able to make sense of the white sphere behind the ornament---is it a shadow or another ornament? This is too bad because this would have been very nice if it were just the blue ornament against the crisp white background. It is well lit and has a nice high key quality I like.</td>', 'I''m not able to make sense of the white sphere behind the ornament---is it a shadow or another ornament? This is too bad because this would have been very nice if it were just the blue ornament against the crisp white background. It is well lit and has a nice high key quality I like.', '2005-12-13 17:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947801, 267619, 7322, '<td valign="top">Holidays? This is a lovely postcard image but I don''t see a connection to the challenge.</td>', 'Holidays? This is a lovely postcard image but I don''t see a connection to the challenge.', '2005-12-13 17:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947813, 267358, 7322, '<td valign="top">The use of selective desaturation is not very effective in this photo. In fact it  is very disturbing. The bright red lips and cheeks on the women give them very creepy and clownish appearance that doesn''t appear intentional.</td>', 'The use of selective desaturation is not very effective in this photo. In fact it  is very disturbing. The bright red lips and cheeks on the women give them very creepy and clownish appearance that doesn''t appear intentional.', '2005-12-13 17:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
