(1948114, 267753, 70, '<td valign="top">I think the setup idea here is good. It''s suffering a bit from lighting problems. The candle flame is awfully bright and the front of Santa isn''t very well lit. Perhaps a little more lighting from the front ot highlight his face?</td>', 'I think the setup idea here is good. It''s suffering a bit from lighting problems. The candle flame is awfully bright and the front of Santa isn''t very well lit. Perhaps a little more lighting from the front ot highlight his face?', '2005-12-13 19:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
