(1948125, 267619, 70, '<td valign="top">To be honest, I feel like this is rather shoehorned into the challenge. That being said, it''s a nice shot, nice lighting but your frame detracts from it quite a bit.</td>', 'To be honest, I feel like this is rather shoehorned into the challenge. That being said, it''s a nice shot, nice lighting but your frame detracts from it quite a bit.', '2005-12-13 19:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1948129, 267515, 70, '<td valign="top">Very nice set up. Love the tree in the back. Overall lighting very nice. Two things I might suggest...the angle of the shot seems slightly low, like we''re looking upwards. Perhaps just a bit higher and straight on. The other is that the border might work better if there was more room around the shot but as it is, I''d prefer just the solid line so that it doesn''t cut into the figurines.</td>', 'Very nice set up. Love the tree in the back. Overall lighting very nice. Two things I might suggest...the angle of the shot seems slightly low, like we''re looking upwards. Perhaps just a bit higher and straight on. The other is that the border might work better if there was more room around the shot but as it is, I''d prefer just the solid line so that it doesn''t cut into the figurines.', '2005-12-13 19:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
