(1948932, 268272, 11487, '<td valign="top">My eye was drawn to the ornament first.  Less attention on the ornament and sharper focus on the ipod would make for a stronger image.  Nice idea.</td>', 'My eye was drawn to the ornament first.  Less attention on the ornament and sharper focus on the ipod would make for a stronger image.  Nice idea.', '2005-12-13 23:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1948942, 267466, 11487, '<td valign="top">Image is overexposed and blends into the background a bit.</td>', 'Image is overexposed and blends into the background a bit.', '2005-12-13 23:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1948950, 267398, 11487, '<td valign="top">Cluttered composition and over exposed slightly.</td>', 'Cluttered composition and over exposed slightly.', '2005-12-13 23:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1948973, 267888, 11487, '<td valign="top">Image shows the right reason for this season...  The main attention to the scene should be the manger, but it''s out of focus.  Reflective surface is distracting.  Image is a little overexposed.</td>', 'Image shows the right reason for this season...  The main attention to the scene should be the manger, but it''s out of focus.  Reflective surface is distracting.  Image is a little overexposed.', '2005-12-13 23:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1948985, 267935, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and DOF.  Reflections in ornament show too much, including the flash.</td>', 'Nice composition and DOF.  Reflections in ornament show too much, including the flash.', '2005-12-13 23:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1948997, 267499, 11487, '<td valign="top">The main focus of the image should be the product.  The decorations take away from that focus.</td>', 'The main focus of the image should be the product.  The decorations take away from that focus.', '2005-12-13 23:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1949004, 268026, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and DOF.  A little better definitions of the eyes would have made this a stronger image.</td>', 'Nice composition and DOF.  A little better definitions of the eyes would have made this a stronger image.', '2005-12-13 23:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1949011, 268051, 49178, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I like the contrast of the B&amp;W, the brightness of the red accent.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice shot!  I like the contrast of the B&W, the brightness of the red accent.  Nice composition.', '2005-12-13 23:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1949183, 267257, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow I love the color and contrast.  Defiantly says Merry Christmas.</td>', 'Wow I love the color and contrast.  Defiantly says Merry Christmas.', '2005-12-14 00:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1949906, 267506, 29490, '<td valign="top">Nice dof and bokeh - good shot.</td>', 'Nice dof and bokeh - good shot.', '2005-12-14 06:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1949915, 268284, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, especially on the lighting, looks very pro and I actually could envision in a catalouge.  Still not really fond of the DOF, would either want more of it and both the ornaments sharp or way less and only a portion of the yellow one in focus.  One of the better shots in the challenge, 7 from me.</td>', 'Nice, especially on the lighting, looks very pro and I actually could envision in a catalouge.  Still not really fond of the DOF, would either want more of it and both the ornaments sharp or way less and only a portion of the yellow one in focus.  One of the better shots in the challenge, 7 from me.', '2005-12-14 06:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1949920, 267728, 27482, '<td valign="top">Dunnow about christmas food, not what we eat here at christmas but that fish sure looks yummy, this would not be a bad advertisement for a restaurant.  Just wish it was a slightly wider shot, would have loved to see more of the horizon, the rest of the fork and the knife.  That or the complete opposite, a more closeup of the fish and lemon.</td>', 'Dunnow about christmas food, not what we eat here at christmas but that fish sure looks yummy, this would not be a bad advertisement for a restaurant.  Just wish it was a slightly wider shot, would have loved to see more of the horizon, the rest of the fork and the knife.  That or the complete opposite, a more closeup of the fish and lemon.', '2005-12-14 06:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1949926, 267619, 27482, '<td valign="top">Argh!  Must say that I STRONGLY dislike the frame... But I tried ignoring it for the sake of the score, I mean, the frame shouldn´t matter.  I just think it is a good frame for the shot if it were haning up on a wall printed in 60x40cm or bigger but on the internet in this resolution it ist just too attention grabbing.  Went so far as to put my fingers over it on the screen to see the shot better.  Love the shot of the ligthouse, think you made a good decision of not including the horizon and I love the warm hues of the sunset (sunrise?).  Would have given it an 8 but I think it´s in a gray area with meeting the challenge and also the frame so I "only" gave it a 7.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Argh!  Must say that I STRONGLY dislike the frame... But I tried ignoring it for the sake of the score, I mean, the frame shouldn´t matter.  I just think it is a good frame for the shot if it were haning up on a wall printed in 60x40cm or bigger but on the internet in this resolution it ist just too attention grabbing.  Went so far as to put my fingers over it on the screen to see the shot better.  Love the shot of the ligthouse, think you made a good decision of not including the horizon and I love the warm hues of the sunset (sunrise?).  Would have given it an 8 but I think it´s in a gray area with meeting the challenge and also the frame so I "only" gave it a 7.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-12-14 06:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1949960, 267357, 28064, '<td valign="top">very cute</td>', 'very cute', '2005-12-14 07:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1949996, 268090, 27482, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty cool, mainly because of phenomenal lighting and the "mist" (whatever it´s made of) sets this image apart from most shots and it creates a very mysterious and cool mood, I would definately consider buying these raindeer if I saw this image in a catalouge.  8 from me.</td>', 'Looks pretty cool, mainly because of phenomenal lighting and the "mist" (whatever it´s made of) sets this image apart from most shots and it creates a very mysterious and cool mood, I would definately consider buying these raindeer if I saw this image in a catalouge.  8 from me.', '2005-12-14 07:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1950005, 267370, 15266, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Love the starlight flare on the lights, nice lighting and composition.</td>', 'Very pretty.  Love the starlight flare on the lights, nice lighting and composition.', '2005-12-14 07:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1950008, 268156, 15266, '<td valign="top">I get Orvis catalogs and this is so dead on it made me laugh.  Very nicely composed, only wish you hadn''t cut the dogs paws off, but won''t score down for that.  Great shot.</td>', 'I get Orvis catalogs and this is so dead on it made me laugh.  Very nicely composed, only wish you hadn''t cut the dogs paws off, but won''t score down for that.  Great shot.', '2005-12-14 07:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1950009, 267534, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the lighting and DOF, very pro and I could see this in a catalouge of some sort.</td>', 'Nice job with the lighting and DOF, very pro and I could see this in a catalouge of some sort.', '2005-12-14 07:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1950012, 267669, 15266, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  The choice of colors is perfect.  Well composed, nicely lighted.</td>', 'Lovely!  The choice of colors is perfect.  Well composed, nicely lighted.', '2005-12-14 07:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1950013, 267819, 15266, '<td valign="top">Best woody shot I''ve seen in a while.  Well composed, well captured.  Great job.</td>', 'Best woody shot I''ve seen in a while.  Well composed, well captured.  Great job.', '2005-12-14 07:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1950017, 267358, 15266, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I don''t think selective desaturation helped to enhance this image, instead its distracting.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I don''t think selective desaturation helped to enhance this image, instead its distracting.', '2005-12-14 07:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1950018, 267739, 27482, '<td valign="top">Outch, that´s a lot of lights, hate to be the one to put this up or take it down.  Cool shot, I still would have liked it better with someone walking down the path to give a sense of scale but other than that very nice, gave this a 7.</td>', 'Outch, that´s a lot of lights, hate to be the one to put this up or take it down.  Cool shot, I still would have liked it better with someone walking down the path to give a sense of scale but other than that very nice, gave this a 7.', '2005-12-14 07:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1950022, 268259, 27482, '<td valign="top">Is this Dansig showing off yet again?  In that case this is way better than most of the shots you do, the lighting is pretty good and the WB is correct.  Gave it a 6.</td>', 'Is this Dansig showing off yet again?  In that case this is way better than most of the shots you do, the lighting is pretty good and the WB is correct.  Gave it a 6.', '2005-12-14 07:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1950031, 268179, 27482, '<td valign="top">Dansig showing off again?  Well in any case, sorry but these shots just don´t appeal to me at all, what is the point with these kind of shots?  To show off?  I just can´t imagine  it doing well in a challenge, you have to put yourself in the voters shoes and this is hardly something most people would vote high for, that includes me.  <br/> <br/>I am voting according to the lighting and composition and technical merits of this picture.  All of them are very mediocre, not bad at all but not good either so I gave it a mediocre score of 5.  Now I seriously encourage you to go out with your expensive equiment and start producing some phenomenal photos, with equipment like that you should have no problems...</td>', 'Dansig showing off again?  Well in any case, sorry but these shots just don´t appeal to me at all, what is the point with these kind of shots?  To show off?  I just can´t imagine  it doing well in a challenge, you have to put yourself in the voters shoes and this is hardly something most people would vote high for, that includes me.   I am voting according to the lighting and composition and technical merits of this picture.  All of them are very mediocre, not bad at all but not good either so I gave it a mediocre score of 5.  Now I seriously encourage you to go out with your expensive equiment and start producing some phenomenal photos, with equipment like that you should have no problems...', '2005-12-14 07:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1950035, 267233, 45764, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty funny.  On a more serious note, how much do one of these kits go for?  I think it would be worth it.</td>', 'That''s pretty funny.  On a more serious note, how much do one of these kits go for?  I think it would be worth it.', '2005-12-14 07:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
