(1951924, 268200, 48717, '<td valign="top">Great, pic.  Love the contrast and lighting.  Don''t know if it is my eye''s, but there seems to be a pink color cast on the shot.  Still one of my tops.</td>', 'Great, pic.  Love the contrast and lighting.  Don''t know if it is my eye''s, but there seems to be a pink color cast on the shot.  Still one of my tops.', '2005-12-14 17:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952151, 268084, 509, '<td valign="top">The composition is ok, but the blown highlights on the jewel and the compression artifacts or oversharpening (jagged lines on the ribbon) hurt this.</td>', 'The composition is ok, but the blown highlights on the jewel and the compression artifacts or oversharpening (jagged lines on the ribbon) hurt this.', '2005-12-14 19:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952153, 267252, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Might benefit from a little more contrast to better isolate the subject from the background, but the soft contrast approach is ok too.  Focus seems a little off on the doll''s face.</td>', 'Nice image.  Might benefit from a little more contrast to better isolate the subject from the background, but the soft contrast approach is ok too.  Focus seems a little off on the doll''s face.', '2005-12-14 19:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952156, 268259, 509, '<td valign="top">Good subject, a little busy in the composition.  Is this in cmyk?  The colors seem a little odd.</td>', 'Good subject, a little busy in the composition.  Is this in cmyk?  The colors seem a little odd.', '2005-12-14 19:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952161, 268264, 509, '<td valign="top">The lighting, while doing a good job of hiding the background, doesn''t do much for the flowers themselves.  I''m not an expert on lighting so I don''t really have any helpful suggestions, but I think it needs something to add emphasis, maybe having one cluster of flowers brighter or darker than the rest to create a strong focal point to the image.</td>', 'The lighting, while doing a good job of hiding the background, doesn''t do much for the flowers themselves.  I''m not an expert on lighting so I don''t really have any helpful suggestions, but I think it needs something to add emphasis, maybe having one cluster of flowers brighter or darker than the rest to create a strong focal point to the image.', '2005-12-14 19:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952165, 268079, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I think it might do better with a white background, or something less vibrant than the red used.  While the red is very good for the holiday aspect, it seems to blend in with the gloves and shoes a little much imho.</td>', 'Nice capture.  I think it might do better with a white background, or something less vibrant than the red used.  While the red is very good for the holiday aspect, it seems to blend in with the gloves and shoes a little much imho.', '2005-12-14 19:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952169, 268272, 509, '<td valign="top">Love the light effects.  The focus could be stronger on the bulb and ipod though.  Any reason for including the ipod?  It seems out of place.  The title might be revised to incorporate meaning for the song playing on the ipod (I would have thought a Christmas song would be more appropriate, but there could be a story here I''m missing).</td>', 'Love the light effects.  The focus could be stronger on the bulb and ipod though.  Any reason for including the ipod?  It seems out of place.  The title might be revised to incorporate meaning for the song playing on the ipod (I would have thought a Christmas song would be more appropriate, but there could be a story here I''m missing).', '2005-12-14 19:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952173, 268225, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  I think the shot would be stronger if there were more lights in the foreground - the plant on the left is cool, but steals attention from the lights imho.  Might want to crop tighter on the bottom too, the pile of snow doesn''t really add to the shot.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  I think the shot would be stronger if there were more lights in the foreground - the plant on the left is cool, but steals attention from the lights imho.  Might want to crop tighter on the bottom too, the pile of snow doesn''t really add to the shot.', '2005-12-14 19:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952178, 267930, 509, '<td valign="top">Great subject and lighting.  Compositionally I''d try this shot with the candles closer to the right edge, maybe with the paper positioned more to the bottom left corner -- music featuring the score with the notes and music lines included often works well for this type of shot too.  Focus is a little soft too, easily fixable.</td>', 'Great subject and lighting.  Compositionally I''d try this shot with the candles closer to the right edge, maybe with the paper positioned more to the bottom left corner -- music featuring the score with the notes and music lines included often works well for this type of shot too.  Focus is a little soft too, easily fixable.', '2005-12-14 19:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952182, 267333, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and subject.  I''d like to see this cropped tighter on the top or at a different angle to have just the ice filling the frame (the background isn''t really necessary imho).</td>', 'Nice focus and subject.  I''d like to see this cropped tighter on the top or at a different angle to have just the ice filling the frame (the background isn''t really necessary imho).', '2005-12-14 19:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952190, 268289, 509, '<td valign="top">Maybe not Christmas, but definitely fits for New Year''s (presumably included in the "holiday" part?)  Nice sharp cat picture.  Some distracting background elements but otherwise technically sound.</td>', 'Maybe not Christmas, but definitely fits for New Year''s (presumably included in the "holiday" part?)  Nice sharp cat picture.  Some distracting background elements but otherwise technically sound.', '2005-12-14 19:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952193, 267845, 509, '<td valign="top">If possible, I''d bounce the flash here or use a slow shutter speed on a tripod to eliminate the shadows.  A different crop might work well too, maybe showing more of the manger scene.</td>', 'If possible, I''d bounce the flash here or use a slow shutter speed on a tripod to eliminate the shadows.  A different crop might work well too, maybe showing more of the manger scene.', '2005-12-14 19:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952195, 267728, 509, '<td valign="top">Not being from Australia, I''m not sure about the connection to the challenge.  Still, this is a really nice shot, very appetizing.  Might crop a little tighter on the top to eliminate the horizon line.  I like the tilted perspective though.</td>', 'Not being from Australia, I''m not sure about the connection to the challenge.  Still, this is a really nice shot, very appetizing.  Might crop a little tighter on the top to eliminate the horizon line.  I like the tilted perspective though.', '2005-12-14 19:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952199, 267431, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I like the duotone inherent here.  A square composition would suit this well (need to crop off a little on the top imho).  Good focus and exposure</td>', 'Nice capture.  I like the duotone inherent here.  A square composition would suit this well (need to crop off a little on the top imho).  Good focus and exposure', '2005-12-14 19:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952203, 267888, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the selective focus used, might be interesting to see the focal point on the manger as well (not sure which I''d prefer).  Good lighting and composition as well.</td>', 'I like the selective focus used, might be interesting to see the focal point on the manger as well (not sure which I''d prefer).  Good lighting and composition as well.', '2005-12-14 19:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952209, 267619, 509, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot, but why the frame? It doesn''t need it imho.  Doesn''t really directly associate with "holiday catalog", but still a nice shot.</td>', 'A lovely shot, but why the frame? It doesn''t need it imho.  Doesn''t really directly associate with "holiday catalog", but still a nice shot.', '2005-12-14 19:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952215, 267903, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the slightly off-center composition.  Good lighting and color as well.  I could see this as a holiday catalog image (though maybe not the cover) - there''s adequate space on top to put some text in as well (for use in a magazine that is).</td>', 'I like the slightly off-center composition.  Good lighting and color as well.  I could see this as a holiday catalog image (though maybe not the cover) - there''s adequate space on top to put some text in as well (for use in a magazine that is).', '2005-12-14 19:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952218, 268280, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but feel this would have been stronger if the focus had been on a non-transparent bulb, or if the background had been white (rather than the pink color) to add some contrast.  Just my opinion though.</td>', 'I like the concept, but feel this would have been stronger if the focus had been on a non-transparent bulb, or if the background had been white (rather than the pink color) to add some contrast.  Just my opinion though.', '2005-12-14 19:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952224, 267935, 509, '<td valign="top">Great focus, lighting and color.  The ribbon is cropped a little tight on the bottom (imho), I''d like to see the whole ribbon in the frame (ie, not include a longer ribbon, but cut it so it fits in the composition shown).  Definitely a good candidate for a holiday catalog.</td>', 'Great focus, lighting and color.  The ribbon is cropped a little tight on the bottom (imho), I''d like to see the whole ribbon in the frame (ie, not include a longer ribbon, but cut it so it fits in the composition shown).  Definitely a good candidate for a holiday catalog.', '2005-12-14 19:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952229, 268080, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, execution could be a little better.  A closer view of the tree might work better, with a bit stronger focus / less camera shake (at this view its tough to tell, but it seems a little soft).</td>', 'Nice idea, execution could be a little better.  A closer view of the tree might work better, with a bit stronger focus / less camera shake (at this view its tough to tell, but it seems a little soft).', '2005-12-14 19:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
