(1952899, 267521, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but lacks a clear focus - the array of items tends towards a busy atmosphere in the picture.</td>', 'Interesting subject, but lacks a clear focus - the array of items tends towards a busy atmosphere in the picture.', '2005-12-14 23:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952901, 268123, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, though the red and teal colors don''t compliment each other that well (imho).  Good focus and exposure.</td>', 'I like the composition, though the red and teal colors don''t compliment each other that well (imho).  Good focus and exposure.', '2005-12-14 23:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952903, 267277, 509, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  Could be a touch bit sharper (the background is a little crisper than the beads).  I really like the subdued colors.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  Could be a touch bit sharper (the background is a little crisper than the beads).  I really like the subdued colors.', '2005-12-14 23:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952906, 268157, 509, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of potential for this subject (I''m guessing Santa''s supports are cloned out?).  That said, I''d suggest leaving a little room in front - rudolph''s front hooves are almost cut off, as well as giving some room in the frame for the sleigh to "fly into".  Are these lit at night?  That might make for an interesting and more dynamic shot as well.</td>', 'There''s a lot of potential for this subject (I''m guessing Santa''s supports are cloned out?).  That said, I''d suggest leaving a little room in front - rudolph''s front hooves are almost cut off, as well as giving some room in the frame for the sleigh to "fly into".  Are these lit at night?  That might make for an interesting and more dynamic shot as well.', '2005-12-14 23:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952909, 268295, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice holiday scene, but could be done a little better I think.  I might suggest playing around with the color a bit to give a warmer tone to this - the gray snow combined with the blue house give a rather cold feeling imho (that may be what you intended, not sure).  A different angle might add interest as well (rather than the flat on approach).</td>', 'Nice holiday scene, but could be done a little better I think.  I might suggest playing around with the color a bit to give a warmer tone to this - the gray snow combined with the blue house give a rather cold feeling imho (that may be what you intended, not sure).  A different angle might add interest as well (rather than the flat on approach).', '2005-12-14 23:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1952911, 268165, 509, '<td valign="top">Good exposure, composition and focus.  I like the slightly colored background as well.</td>', 'Good exposure, composition and focus.  I like the slightly colored background as well.', '2005-12-14 23:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
