(1953432, 267227, 509, '<td valign="top">Great composition - I''m not sure what the triangle shaped object is but I like the diagonals it introduces into the frame.  It also helps create a greater sense of depth.  There are some distracting background elements in the background (towards the right edge of the shot), but otherwise a nice image.</td>', 'Great composition - I''m not sure what the triangle shaped object is but I like the diagonals it introduces into the frame.  It also helps create a greater sense of depth.  There are some distracting background elements in the background (towards the right edge of the shot), but otherwise a nice image.', '2005-12-15 08:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1953434, 267895, 509, '<td valign="top">Very festive.  The lit tree in the background blends well with the foreground plant.  I like the soft lighting used on the plant as well - the low contrast adds to the warmness of the shot.</td>', 'Very festive.  The lit tree in the background blends well with the foreground plant.  I like the soft lighting used on the plant as well - the low contrast adds to the warmness of the shot.', '2005-12-15 08:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
