(1953808, 268026, 27514, '<td valign="top">very nice high key image! I like most of it, there isn''t much background seperation but that is a problem you can get into to. trying using another light to seperate the subject from the background and gain a 2 to 1 ratio.  good overall, really stands out from the rest of the challenge 8</td>', 'very nice high key image! I like most of it, there isn''t much background seperation but that is a problem you can get into to. trying using another light to seperate the subject from the background and gain a 2 to 1 ratio.  good overall, really stands out from the rest of the challenge 8', '2005-12-15 11:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
