(1953853, 267333, 27514, '<td valign="top">very nice shot and very well done. I would like to see the crop played with just a little bit, mabey no background just the watch and the snow. either way it''s a very well done shot. the lighting is very diffuse and that is nice to see and your lighting ratio is dead on! great job 10</td>', 'very nice shot and very well done. I would like to see the crop played with just a little bit, mabey no background just the watch and the snow. either way it''s a very well done shot. the lighting is very diffuse and that is nice to see and your lighting ratio is dead on! great job 10', '2005-12-15 12:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1953869, 267722, 27514, '<td valign="top">lacks in sharpness and the color balance looks very magenta. I like the idea your going for though. mabey don''t use sucha  reflective background for the table (the single plane) and mabey try lighting from above . the glass has all kinds of glares in it and so does the plate. that is the nature of lighting with christmas lights though. I do like the background but the single orniment is a little distracting. overall an average shot, 5</td>', 'lacks in sharpness and the color balance looks very magenta. I like the idea your going for though. mabey don''t use sucha  reflective background for the table (the single plane) and mabey try lighting from above . the glass has all kinds of glares in it and so does the plate. that is the nature of lighting with christmas lights though. I do like the background but the single orniment is a little distracting. overall an average shot, 5', '2005-12-15 12:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
