(1955027, 268051, 2829, '<td valign="top">Nice but there''s nothing in this photo that pops out as the primary subject. The red in the tires seems to lead the eye down there and I don''t think you''re selling tires or tricycles.</td>', 'Nice but there''s nothing in this photo that pops out as the primary subject. The red in the tires seems to lead the eye down there and I don''t think you''re selling tires or tricycles.', '2005-12-15 21:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
