(1955088, 267819, 36382, '<td valign="top">nice dof</td>', 'nice dof', '2005-12-15 21:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955096, 268280, 2829, '<td valign="top">Nice photo...There are a few things that are a bit on the distracting side...There is some noise...Particularly in the top left ornament. Also, the image isn''t screaming tack sharp but I suspect both of these may be due to camera. It also appears to be a bit flat, perhaps due to lack of contrast. Composition is very good: ornaments meet at a cingle focal point which is approximately following the rule of thirds. The stripes also lead to the focal point. Good neutral background here.</td>', 'Nice photo...There are a few things that are a bit on the distracting side...There is some noise...Particularly in the top left ornament. Also, the image isn''t screaming tack sharp but I suspect both of these may be due to camera. It also appears to be a bit flat, perhaps due to lack of contrast. Composition is very good: ornaments meet at a cingle focal point which is approximately following the rule of thirds. The stripes also lead to the focal point. Good neutral background here.', '2005-12-15 21:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955118, 267669, 2829, '<td valign="top">Interesting....A few comments that instantly popped into my head...<br/>I would have tried using Red, Green Blue...Simply because that be the RGB color space. There is red...and it''s a very overwhelming color especially for a background. I think you would have hade a bit more success with a grey or dark green backgrounds here. Or, even using a christmas tree to hang these off of and use as a background. Not sure I like the depth of field here. The first two are in focus and the third starts getting fuzzy on me. I like the diagonal arrangement though.</td>', 'Interesting....A few comments that instantly popped into my head...I would have tried using Red, Green Blue...Simply because that be the RGB color space. There is red...and it''s a very overwhelming color especially for a background. I think you would have hade a bit more success with a grey or dark green backgrounds here. Or, even using a christmas tree to hang these off of and use as a background. Not sure I like the depth of field here. The first two are in focus and the third starts getting fuzzy on me. I like the diagonal arrangement though.', '2005-12-15 21:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955120, 268157, 2829, '<td valign="top">Trippy...That tree top is oddly placed.</td>', 'Trippy...That tree top is oddly placed.', '2005-12-15 21:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955124, 267581, 2829, '<td valign="top">Soft image, the face looks a bit out of focus to me but it could be my eyes, I haven''t drank today though!...What kind of a catalog would this be in? This photo seems to lack emphasis on a subject.</td>', 'Soft image, the face looks a bit out of focus to me but it could be my eyes, I haven''t drank today though!...What kind of a catalog would this be in? This photo seems to lack emphasis on a subject.', '2005-12-15 21:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955130, 268300, 2829, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-12-15 21:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955138, 267368, 2829, '<td valign="top">Nice use of leaves for the background. The bottom edge isn''t covered though. The arrangement is not strong and doesn''t engage the viewer. I looked at all 3 sets of earrings and was finished with the image. I think a might tighter crop would have been great here. In particular I find the peacock earrings to be very interesting and intriguing. The ones at the top are interesting for their texture.</td>', 'Nice use of leaves for the background. The bottom edge isn''t covered though. The arrangement is not strong and doesn''t engage the viewer. I looked at all 3 sets of earrings and was finished with the image. I think a might tighter crop would have been great here. In particular I find the peacock earrings to be very interesting and intriguing. The ones at the top are interesting for their texture.', '2005-12-15 21:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955144, 267188, 2829, '<td valign="top">You shot through the glass without a polarizing filter. There''s a very odd streak int he lower right corner of the window. Naturally I follow the window edges around to find that this photo was shot at an angle and it doesn''t line up with the photo edge. You could have cropped that or just shot straight on.</td>', 'You shot through the glass without a polarizing filter. There''s a very odd streak int he lower right corner of the window. Naturally I follow the window edges around to find that this photo was shot at an angle and it doesn''t line up with the photo edge. You could have cropped that or just shot straight on.', '2005-12-15 21:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955146, 268026, 2829, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2005-12-15 21:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955166, 268199, 2829, '<td valign="top">great idea, only suggestion was to use matted decorations all the way around. Those shiny ones reflect the light almost enough to be distracting.</td>', 'great idea, only suggestion was to use matted decorations all the way around. Those shiny ones reflect the light almost enough to be distracting.', '2005-12-15 22:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
