(1955888, 267518, 32378, '<td valign="top">This is a little busy for me.  What is the subject the watch or the necklace.  The close crop at the top and heavy shadows also bothered me.</td>', 'This is a little busy for me.  What is the subject the watch or the necklace.  The close crop at the top and heavy shadows also bothered me.', '2005-12-16 08:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
