(1955891, 268272, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the star effects given off by the lights add sparkle and that holiday feeling to the picture.  However I''m not sure what the subject is, the ornament or the ipod.</td>', 'I like the star effects given off by the lights add sparkle and that holiday feeling to the picture.  However I''m not sure what the subject is, the ornament or the ipod.', '2005-12-16 08:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955892, 268264, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice even tones in this one, I like the balance and composition.  Not sure if this is something I''d see in a catalog though with the dark background, something lighter may have made it appear more festive.</td>', 'Nice even tones in this one, I like the balance and composition.  Not sure if this is something I''d see in a catalog though with the dark background, something lighter may have made it appear more festive.', '2005-12-16 08:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
