(1955904, 267351, 32378, '<td valign="top">Okay didn''t know how to rate this the first couple times I looked at it.  But I like the humor in it, I like the soft lighting, although I think I would loose the picture of the man and dog, doesn''t really add much IMO.</td>', 'Okay didn''t know how to rate this the first couple times I looked at it.  But I like the humor in it, I like the soft lighting, although I think I would loose the picture of the man and dog, doesn''t really add much IMO.', '2005-12-16 08:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955907, 267720, 32378, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t do a whole lot for me.  It seems like it lack punch and needs more than just a plain whit background.  Also which item is the subject, they don''t seem to be related, at least to me.  The lighting is nice and even though without out any blown out highlits and it is in good focus so there are good thinkgs about it also.</td>', 'This shot doesn''t do a whole lot for me.  It seems like it lack punch and needs more than just a plain whit background.  Also which item is the subject, they don''t seem to be related, at least to me.  The lighting is nice and even though without out any blown out highlits and it is in good focus so there are good thinkgs about it also.', '2005-12-16 08:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955914, 268079, 32378, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot, however after looking at it for awhile it needs something.  Maybe another color back ground, the red feet and hands tend to blend into the back ground and keeps the subject from poping out.  Perhaps a green background would have been better to give some contrast to the red and blue and bring out the green in the hat a litte.</td>', 'This is a good shot, however after looking at it for awhile it needs something.  Maybe another color back ground, the red feet and hands tend to blend into the back ground and keeps the subject from poping out.  Perhaps a green background would have been better to give some contrast to the red and blue and bring out the green in the hat a litte.', '2005-12-16 08:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955915, 268052, 29658, '<td valign="top">Good idea, good lighting.<br/></td>', 'Good idea, good lighting.', '2005-12-16 08:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955918, 267293, 32378, '<td valign="top">I didn''t score this real well for several reasons.  First the crope seems a little tight and the back ground too busy.  I think the entire subject needs to be in focus for this to work without the base being slightly blown out.  I think I would have tried shooting this from a lower angle it is the shape that tells us what it is I really don''t need to see empty places for the candles.</td>', 'I didn''t score this real well for several reasons.  First the crope seems a little tight and the back ground too busy.  I think the entire subject needs to be in focus for this to work without the base being slightly blown out.  I think I would have tried shooting this from a lower angle it is the shape that tells us what it is I really don''t need to see empty places for the candles.', '2005-12-16 09:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955920, 268152, 29658, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, great eyes!</td>', 'Nice picture, great eyes!', '2005-12-16 09:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955929, 267853, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the elegance of your shot, maybe a touch too much blue tone for something romantic like this a warmer tone may have worked better.  The only other suggestion I would have is try tilting the subjet the other way from let to right instead of right to left.  The right to left is a little uncomfortable and left to right is a little more natural I think.</td>', 'I like the elegance of your shot, maybe a touch too much blue tone for something romantic like this a warmer tone may have worked better.  The only other suggestion I would have is try tilting the subjet the other way from let to right instead of right to left.  The right to left is a little uncomfortable and left to right is a little more natural I think.', '2005-12-16 09:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955936, 268168, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the warm tones of this and the feeling of home.  I would have stuck with one subject, the flannel I don''t think the empty plate adds anything, and almost makes it look like the child is begging for food, although I''m sure this wasn''t your intention. The lighting on the right is a little harsh and I think I would have maybe liked him standing so I could see more of the stockings.</td>', 'I like the warm tones of this and the feeling of home.  I would have stuck with one subject, the flannel I don''t think the empty plate adds anything, and almost makes it look like the child is begging for food, although I''m sure this wasn''t your intention. The lighting on the right is a little harsh and I think I would have maybe liked him standing so I could see more of the stockings.', '2005-12-16 09:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1955941, 268112, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this and the idea.  Seems like the color could use a little more pop for the holidays.  I may have tried lighting this a little more head on to the front of the eninge to take some attention away from the ornament in the upper corner.</td>', 'I like the composition of this and the idea.  Seems like the color could use a little more pop for the holidays.  I may have tried lighting this a little more head on to the front of the eninge to take some attention away from the ornament in the upper corner.', '2005-12-16 09:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
