(1957054, 268179, 2829, '<td valign="top">I was looking to do something similar to this but mine wasn''t nearly as good as that. I didn''t like the composition so I tossed it. A few things though...The charger and the cable are taking the center stage for some reason and I don''t think you''re trying to emphasize those. I would have gotten rid of them completely and put the camera in place of the charger. The lights on the box are questionable in my opinion, I would look to replace it with a tree branch instead. The decorations on the right side are a nice touch and the photo has good depth.  I love the way the lens is wearing a santa hat.</td>', 'I was looking to do something similar to this but mine wasn''t nearly as good as that. I didn''t like the composition so I tossed it. A few things though...The charger and the cable are taking the center stage for some reason and I don''t think you''re trying to emphasize those. I would have gotten rid of them completely and put the camera in place of the charger. The lights on the box are questionable in my opinion, I would look to replace it with a tree branch instead. The decorations on the right side are a nice touch and the photo has good depth.  I love the way the lens is wearing a santa hat.', '2005-12-16 20:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
