(1960065, 268258, 1054, '<td valign="top">The yellow rail behind the dancer is a bit distracting, and the softness (motion blur?) takes away from this entry as well. I''m left wondering if this is a shot from a holiday show that just happened to fit the challenge. For this to pass as a catalog shot, I believe you would need to have more control if your background and lighting.</td>', 'The yellow rail behind the dancer is a bit distracting, and the softness (motion blur?) takes away from this entry as well. I''m left wondering if this is a shot from a holiday show that just happened to fit the challenge. For this to pass as a catalog shot, I believe you would need to have more control if your background and lighting.', '2005-12-18 12:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
