(1962272, 267351, 28710, '<td valign="top">Ok. 48 seconds on the laugh-meter.<br/> <br/>I think it might actually be a bit more effective without the slightly more commonplace Gas-X and Jock Itch. <br/> <br/>Simply arranging a bunch of expected, simple gifts like the razor, scope, basic bathroom goodies that every guy expects in a "gift basket", along with maybe some other things like cologne and maybe a watch or something to really set the mood and slide that Butt Paste in there in the middle.<br/> <br/>I actually worked in the health field for a few years and I NEVER heard of that stuff.<br/> <br/>I was given a VCR cassete about shark cartilage that had been relabeled in black marker "Keiran''s Barnyard Porn" once though.</td>', 'Ok. 48 seconds on the laugh-meter. I think it might actually be a bit more effective without the slightly more commonplace Gas-X and Jock Itch.  Simply arranging a bunch of expected, simple gifts like the razor, scope, basic bathroom goodies that every guy expects in a "gift basket", along with maybe some other things like cologne and maybe a watch or something to really set the mood and slide that Butt Paste in there in the middle. I actually worked in the health field for a few years and I NEVER heard of that stuff. I was given a VCR cassete about shark cartilage that had been relabeled in black marker "Keiran''s Barnyard Porn" once though.', '2005-12-19 09:44:30.000000', NULL, 0),
