(1962352, 268227, 35804, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mesmeraj:</b></div><hr/><i> i hope you mean to say it was in the style of a circa 55 mag cover and not a real magazine cover?<br/>I really loved this, but i am kind of worried now... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes Elli..."in the style of"...how silly of me, I must remember my semantics here at DPC...but no need to worry...this is very much my image and I do have the proof to back that up.<br/> <br/>: }</td>', 'Originally posted by mesmeraj: i hope you mean to say it was in the style of a circa 55 mag cover and not a real magazine cover?I really loved this, but i am kind of worried now...   Yes Elli..."in the style of"...how silly of me, I must remember my semantics here at DPC...but no need to worry...this is very much my image and I do have the proof to back that up. : }', '2005-12-19 10:29:18.000000', NULL, 0),
